  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941dd612812bee9b8087efb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在就连亚洲黑熊\r\n都不会是我的对手！喝啊！\r\n三两下就能轻易打倒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789e550c7be3cb16cbfcf6f8776bee4deccbfa554375f5a173b0175b1c3fd1a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc1f1ed2ae8b1210a41c44f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，受你照顾了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26701c769cfefbbbea86ff99e56377c406a729226c931062ee990cfcc18a12e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3adb6c854e3f7e2874cbfa96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華麗に！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1193af77321b313d7a2601f1f12b43d78f3aef22aa5726e78bb5f8891ac55c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde5c047c35cfd1bc8b5916b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不只这样呢～！！\r\n敬请期待下回！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65cae4c56c3f6a07af931be1fe350be32f2cae8aa1749067ecde38bf93edaef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f69fd1ce6b9ce8bf41fa90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算是差强人意的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5423da4a3da85c2bea9839c46b327802dcb19dd80e8ae6942c647eace9e1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1191c316cc4bee1c0679474d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的成果无法令人满意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d059493e070db58e55b622398bbe5358f2c92e8ffcdbb05faa2f3a3cbf90dd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40646065a279ae8e699abb96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次可不会这样了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05ff5215b4988ea10d8e5e836d6c027a0aceaf81443ed5f80c62a306a09319e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006d6f22cacd5d775beb766f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主大获全胜！\r\n这是理所当然的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a6356ad5b4afbffeb7928e5b2cb25edbbf4a70fec7e7daef1d6e542e2af717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa0211f396c194cc5814bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有看到公主的杰出表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "275c2a990753219ce74f8e44e3118f974295b4c991837491d25a22e8bf1a002e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d329f8b83475fc838aca7cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごらんあれ！これが華麗な姫の舞…ですわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f3a16fccb11372d0a0007ce1a6b31d9c41e374d4c3e004ccfdad8055f1aa4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90164776367774191be7c0a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫の活躍、ごらんいただけまして？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b58516ab62b548a8da512710eaa55d89fc9b6d985bafe83918a8e800adcd9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95e549a6ebb15b49d962d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主上场☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6447f551943518a89cb84d25a9d79f8cfc3b5a6a1eb654f6e514374fff07960d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52bafe5a7207bb91ec516667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀☆攻击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afb696e401950d2a553fe61531f424acf85c54d8a39892bd8f344e77f6fc88ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1848fa8aa9c03a16c5a54c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんと一緒のお舞台…！\r\n気合い入れて臨みますわよっ！\r\nまずは…目指せ握力400㎏！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60b5232160b7a4a7cf55c9f5478379624505a0f43e24c22c9edc1799e28536c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c597f793ddcdea4cb741168b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……哼……！很好！\r\n我现在充满干劲，\r\n就连感谢祭也能一口气跑完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ab5b235381961318db3966949781c2563ca467ff1e9295f0ddf02f81989c048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bd1e5a9b1e27083ba93f13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就让大家见识一下，\r\n身为公主的意志力吧！意志力、\r\n意志力、超强意志力～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2997ca01d8f2928b72658b52ed67a2899c9adc7f94f7d4ce18f5aca0fb2135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a544c1a72a9a2cfcb7a46886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "でぇええりゃああああーー！！\r\n血ヘド吐いてでも演じ切りますわ！\r\nこの想い！この気合い！この拳で！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9bb84cfa6c615d0915b57fb53f459eb66c161f418404cd255450903e004fbe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50c6731cb7b40275e06e693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他でもないこの私に、キングさんは\r\n想いを託してくださった。\r\n…応えられましたかしら、ちゃんと",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7ef4daeccee0893a0508911984ecad921e0536c7fcf3d16ae7dd509e975418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45304a8d1215c3ce54dd4301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽高雅最强最快！川上公主！\r\n全都让开！公主要通过咯！！\r\nVictory！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1eab6cb224aae514eb1882f3b0ddec7ceb93d4ac872c4a21b5aea2d90314aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1247fb98cc710dd8a4c4e7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务是在这里确认！\r\n既然目标是成为一流的公主……\r\n就只能拼命往前冲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb7ef96df891211055d5c2f50bfa87ba51cc214dc349ffcd0a785f7c8c8064d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c81d6d817d25e5dcfd8cfab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别忘了领取报酬！\r\n把报酬和重要回忆一起带回去后，\r\n活动才算是正式结束喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b966a86eeb54b5163759c4c936678eea3b48acc8c6a8649d6393331b6c39852d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ffc914a5c4241b774e9769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝶のように舞い、姫のごとく砕く！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e5576cd2acf308466a96c2acc1ac155243928fdd75b785bcc654fb691f4638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5015e435b51f8ef6d014848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "掛けまくも畏き三柱に…\r\n姫たる舞をご奉納ですわっ、どっせええ～い！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e31e15fa7ad261ca5e5531fe951e6e1dff573c28f33353ab610e2c45ca82645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3724db2e9ccf514abe9cfde4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6b0c83feadc082eddfdc34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3089ea8e79450048eb9505f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc8b13604d3e0630735e014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13e84f299f5f5056599a3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414ae427217adea7b80c6d9166bb6ebc72df2f6b1b370616339ff4156cfba39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e5e3373890dfca045f90da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414ae427217adea7b80c6d9166bb6ebc72df2f6b1b370616339ff4156cfba39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2f0b780a14dfa49ab75b85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9abc5c9ff61bd39d9ae50cd1cac2b8d52195360c80f49e2d6a2e6208d1d8836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ae08139c63c66fb142fa33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9abc5c9ff61bd39d9ae50cd1cac2b8d52195360c80f49e2d6a2e6208d1d8836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693484e35311301ee012f267",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9abc5c9ff61bd39d9ae50cd1cac2b8d52195360c80f49e2d6a2e6208d1d8836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f8446c2bc3e27b85351019b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞会要开始了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92bf0531bf49c772264d14a41064f8d08b150a4d7561dccf0016c37ce8bc731f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be672e7deef4254b4b3b9005",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请好好看着吧，王子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6bd4a90df9930fe2732c5cfda901b29576d15a43aa4be6f230f9a8619d093f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdb712c79980c534866c424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会惹人怜爱并优雅地奋力冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd4261cc19f57841011763d98b822fbc374679cd17f36fe7707ad20fa15b59b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6cf8939c92bed61f0032b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强最快的公主传说──\r\n属于我们的故事，\r\n会一直不断上演～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f28eb17032fa92013e8249856d9f641c3a8d5ab04ddb09a39c1f2b1df561e6b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9243451952b0dc7d7163b94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不负特雷森学生之名的\r\n高雅仪容对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2026db731b49339e6eb84e3af8bcd8803e1113ded03eed211c79b18f6c101603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d316592f7cbb0265bcf3a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得这套衣服很像是\r\n公主战士的演唱会服装吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd17d5f55e1deab69d19a2d1e3fa5472dc889489bad7dff7fc2f8cb0b24513ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca8d59bc94303a4d10471bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的公主装！\r\n川上特别型态～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07cbafa0c9d3f7f7f03a966b36f8aa35caf15b839f4c2ca167ec7462df90970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988fca12993c7099f38f123b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乍看之下是学园随处可见的普通学生。\r\n但她其实是──最强的公主，川上～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62e670273c856c6e7d911a8fbe2284b0fe4ca8bcde1715c3700da67249b0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38287efd1f6df207a14562de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔来场拿着变身杖的\r\n演唱会不觉得也挺不错的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "992e3b062eb2b3ab469553ee4f14a5a25888b5bfdd316758670809917d23b1ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbe533b610bb2440f9377c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服的公主无人能敌……\r\n会展现更闪闪发亮的耀眼光辉喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2894cd1403b4af75c7ebc5024c7c267740b35aa0f2eadf1871f7f9c63e79791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d2edb2be53ba428e0b9b60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つつましく神々しく…\r\n和のプリンセス見参っ！ですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4636684d8b6059389d28e331914cb4a1e2e2b48f7bf92c675c3ece31c2ff06e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb660b6d8ab8231ee11d8fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこかに引っかけて\r\n破かないようにしませんとっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76adb72828dbad205c35097fd11c1b7f40b50dc675ca738ca946a5b295968190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6739dc7da29f7d57007227d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～啦啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aafd59703ed99cd51364ceffe116fc2e63a08d70a8de585054ba51d21bbc10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43d579eb862272895757ed6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力打飞敌人咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b1c62c308d34187507b2c4805107db45533142a429add8c06b075df2ce2799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e099b926d3ab4801badc2d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プリンセス、カジュアルフォーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd5f44903505bb8330f33dc14f9e3071ca5af0ee2dcd3deac0d8175a9fb6a6ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847097193bacc23179dc84f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫の休日は、お買い物にダンスパーティーに\r\n道場破りに大忙しですわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a0ce25b7e91257694dfe6f1f1b1471b14f0839f16ac1028cf7891aaa9592ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3bffd73f9acbb66f43bb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不负特雷森学生之名的\r\n高雅仪容对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2026db731b49339e6eb84e3af8bcd8803e1113ded03eed211c79b18f6c101603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1c0bb2251a423c341e4c81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得这套衣服很像是\r\n公主战士的演唱会服装吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd17d5f55e1deab69d19a2d1e3fa5472dc889489bad7dff7fc2f8cb0b24513ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0bbc88c05155300d0405a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的公主装！\r\n川上特别型态～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07cbafa0c9d3f7f7f03a966b36f8aa35caf15b839f4c2ca167ec7462df90970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fc376c2f893a59626734b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乍看之下是学园随处可见的普通学生。\r\n但她其实是──最强的公主，川上～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62e670273c856c6e7d911a8fbe2284b0fe4ca8bcde1715c3700da67249b0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc8c5ddbab9bca71e515e8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔来场拿着变身杖的\r\n演唱会不觉得也挺不错的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "992e3b062eb2b3ab469553ee4f14a5a25888b5bfdd316758670809917d23b1ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4b9f46210ddaad2710e1fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服的公主无人能敌……\r\n会展现更闪闪发亮的耀眼光辉喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2894cd1403b4af75c7ebc5024c7c267740b35aa0f2eadf1871f7f9c63e79791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2a0c98c916002dc9dbb45c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つつましく神々しく…\r\n和のプリンセス見参っ！ですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4636684d8b6059389d28e331914cb4a1e2e2b48f7bf92c675c3ece31c2ff06e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ba29f96d3bbcc976330df7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこかに引っかけて\r\n破かないようにしませんとっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76adb72828dbad205c35097fd11c1b7f40b50dc675ca738ca946a5b295968190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62d65c366518fc53122da11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～啦啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aafd59703ed99cd51364ceffe116fc2e63a08d70a8de585054ba51d21bbc10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852ede11ffccfcbcd1d15505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力打飞敌人咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b1c62c308d34187507b2c4805107db45533142a429add8c06b075df2ce2799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266b560a4a53dca13550e13c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f730acb13dc5c9ae2f608f77e2e8c8793a1cb90d1b908acc1ebeb904f42f21f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a6869d5fe18c7002461b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！\r\n我接受挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c0a2efcd6fdaa46cd515b1bae2cb105fdd872ad243b45c106d669d91fe8b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35e5a7912143eeb740318d1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这算什么！不管几次，\r\n公主都会重新振作～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b38843aa16bd240cd4ae869a3fd0cd7308003858c54e98419964f850073bc87f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a19a7641bf7da3432c3e2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也会像个公主\r\n打趴对手喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73cd3f4e057cd325dd92845fe5b17498357137cb8c58c34529bb1d60be4ce3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d033925ec8b9ebd42317e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快开始上课了。\r\n好好用功学习，下次一定\r\n要摆脱不及格公主的称号～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e265d195fb5b5cba7621409394c45b2facc79c0f6d57514b6388e62c479991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1b96feae2a9bb6cf8013eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好♪\r\n这是圣王亲自传授的问候方式喔！\r\n喔──呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ed0c59bd8a7fd86c38de53c35f19e7bcb6999dab876e47d6562f77083c4c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df21d704c1817d77205489bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，\r\n该喝的下午茶喝完了，\r\n下午也要好好加油咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a211e5b9f281d3a7e3e994def08228c0f4703d47f897e333ac197fe2807c2b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0a0e1326558b829338ba851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间都还这么有精神呢。\r\n真不愧是\r\n公主的训练员喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb44fef06cc9b48628c1d7925a34d4d0c016a83737a5ab2f97d5b9455c6299bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7a6b78d781d25419cfe7f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上也不能掉以轻心！\r\n因为我想让王子\r\n无时无刻都看到最棒的我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdeeda1ea412e6f81f58f340cc33fd64bf457483238ef4527339e0fb64cc13da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96b562eda42ee7419176db3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年有骨气的新生\r\n还不少呢！要不要由\r\n本公主亲自办一场欢迎会呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc932df63fb5bf9f7bf52ceb694cf09e85afff1a68dcb4e177598fc86ee60fd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2727283d6982639275c637a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灿烂的阳光♪\r\n公主的心也热血沸腾，\r\n完全不输给太阳喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b4e817cfbab5b2dcd182d9cb831ad73ccedac5c302cc09e6aff32cdd8350a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee419f2837c788dee7e5b4c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要不要也参加栗子对决？\r\n只要互丢总苞栗子就好，\r\n是很简单的游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58170d60057bbdb48d695dc01365dfaa02df8d49503fbeaaedb4a82b0e38625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e988c07a937ce03ca4fe884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉还挺冷的呢。\r\n这种时候──没错！\r\n建议要用干布摩擦身体！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89f69268dd36402414e4270fc74352b386015e3e542cec6d26dc79083d8d6fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a98c61e2f81376f611a182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1日の始まりにこのリボンを結ぶと\r\n姫ゲージがマックスになりますの！\r\nキングさんとお揃いなんですもの～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3c55f42581a515626eb1a40cec78e56a8ea606856958f4b022cd85242bf4ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a7b5cabdf7463982af48ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝のどんぶり飯だって、この衣装で\r\n食べればしっとり上品に\r\n見えると思いませんかっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57730065bce68745c0f51b4c2ce9c05aa368b4203018098443b73fd7c85d88ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61dadbe68dc3fc03d00a0cee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、おやつはいかが？\r\n実はお袖の中にこっそり忍ばせて\r\nますの！便利ですわー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "557b601634dc4203787e4ad9ecac2428d0ec68e624e47ea8c3ca8ba6bbfad56f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ec634550e20e3cb29c72b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぅん…姫…たるもの…ふわぁ。\r\nご飯のあとの眠気には\r\nふぐぐ…ま…負けませんわよ～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d421e46f699ededecd85356d69b20a13f023134309326fd25b569101ebf96649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e44373aca75d922efcfd2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このきらびやかなお衣装！これだけ\r\n神々しければ、夜でも怖いおばけは\r\n寄ってきませんわよね？ねっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9279157ba3dd215f51434cf210c4d1d99123090671efb7126517bbdfc381f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d023c9a30696ad823717ae4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このお衣装、おねむの時間に\r\n着替えるのは大変で…パールさんに\r\nいつも手伝ってもらってますの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d5befa45ef3d35b46b0fb709cb6b73ebb82981f835cf188272a60cfe28005e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bf3f07fb65d20bfc805abba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生の方々に、昔の姫君のよう\r\nって褒めてもらいましたのっ♪\r\nこの衣装で出迎えて正解でしたわ～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3dccd4421d09bee69cf501f00c37531eeb7d772e27e654cc7e70c2829470a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac614438f867bae32aa7896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も熱っちいですわね～。\r\nこの姿でひと差し舞ったら\r\n雨のひとつも降りますかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "145b6f5059c51f59d8a5e464df6bf675d14203f70b8112865d0fe814da520772",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83c46e01931e501dadaeb2b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "芋！栗！かぼちゃ！\r\n大地の恵みに感謝の舞を捧げてから\r\n…ガッツリ山盛りいただきますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f025a6b0edc01e7e903498393146c853655d23df2faff8d5fcf107f04dcb1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
